{"id":"ea1eda7a3ad5e5c0","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-gross-zagier.md","title":"Gross–Zagier Equality Datum","display":"df-gross-zagier — Gross–Zagier Equality Datum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-gross-zagier","aliases":["58-df-gross-zagier"],"display":"df-gross-zagier — Gross–Zagier Equality Datum","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-heegner-point.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-gross-zagier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-gross-zagier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gross-zagier — Gross–Zagier Equality Datum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"32927f4e222d9c70\" href=\"?note=32927f4e222d9c70\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-heegner-point.md\">../batch03/58-df-heegner-point.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74f4744df7db749f\" href=\"?note=74f4744df7db749f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md\">../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,k,O,K_E,P,K,c,\\ell&#39;_1,h_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\Omega_E\\in V\">\\(E,k,O,K_E,P,K,c,\\ell&#39;_1,h_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\Omega_E\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,k,O,K_E)\">\\(\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,k,O,K_E)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HeegnerPoint}_S(P,E,K)\">\\(\\mathrm{HeegnerPoint}_S(P,E,K)\\)</span> are the exact upstream predicates.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GrossZagierDatum}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\">\\(\\mathrm{GrossZagierDatum}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\\)</span> is the equality-data predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gross\\text{-}zagier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GrossZagierDatum}_S(E,k,O,K_E,P,K,c,\\ell&#39;_1,h_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\Omega_E)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,k,O,K_E)\n\\land\\mathrm{HeegnerPoint}_S(P,E,K)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\n\\land\\ell&#39;_1\\in\\mathbb R\n\\land h_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\n\\land\\Omega_E\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\ell&#39;_1=c\\,\\frac{h_{\\mathrm{NT}}}{\\Omega_E}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gross\\text{-}zagier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GrossZagierDatum}_S(E,k,O,K_E,P,K,c,\\ell&#39;_1,h_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\Omega_E)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,k,O,K_E)\n\\land\\mathrm{HeegnerPoint}_S(P,E,K)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\n\\land\\ell&#39;_1\\in\\mathbb R\n\\land h_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\n\\land\\Omega_E\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\ell&#39;_1=c\\,\\frac{h_{\\mathrm{NT}}}{\\Omega_E}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The base field, marked point, canonical-bundle datum, quadratic field, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-derivative value, Néron–Tate height, and period are explicit. The predicate records the Gross–Zagier equality without treating these choices as functions of the bare set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-heegner-point.md","status":"resolved","id":"32927f4e222d9c70","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-heegner-point.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md","status":"resolved","id":"74f4744df7db749f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E,k,O,K_E,P,K,c,\\ell'_1,h_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\Omega_E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,k,O,K_E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HeegnerPoint}_S(P,E,K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GrossZagierDatum}_S\\subseteq V^{10}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gross\\text{-}zagier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GrossZagierDatum}_S(E,k,O,K_E,P,K,c,\\ell'_1,h_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\Omega_E)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,k,O,K_E)\n\\land\\mathrm{HeegnerPoint}_S(P,E,K)\\\\\n&{}\\land c\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\n\\land\\ell'_1\\in\\mathbb R\n\\land h_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\n\\land\\Omega_E\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\\\\n&{}\\land\\ell'_1=c\\,\\frac{h_{\\mathrm{NT}}}{\\Omega_E}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false}],"bytes":1338,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-594","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-gross-zagier.md|58-df-gross-zagier]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["32927f4e222d9c70","74f4744df7db749f"]}